<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Frost Mages in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses of Tier 15 provide a great boost for Frost, as it makes the spec as a whole feel far more mobile and consistent by increasing the chance of getting <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=30455/ice-lance">
